  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">HCDH - Soutien au UN Human Rights Officeen Ouganda</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OHCHR - Support to the UN Human Rights Office in Uganda 2021-2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) Renforcer l&apos;&#xC9;tat de droit et l&apos;obligation de rendre compte des violations des droits de
l&apos;homme

2) Promotion l&#x2019;&#xE9;galit&#xE9; et lutter contre la discrimination

3) Am&#xE9;liorer et prot&#xE9;ger l&#x2019;espace civique et la participation des citoyens

4) Int&#xE9;grer les droits de l&apos;homme dans le d&#xE9;veloppement durable

5) Un engagement renforc&#xE9; avec les m&#xE9;canismes des droits humains</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This proposal outlines the mid- to long-term vision for the work of the UN Human Rights Office in Uganda. The new Host Country Agreement mandates the Country Office to advise and assist the Government of Uganda on the formulation and implementation of policies, programmes and measures for the promotion and protection of human rights; strengthen the capacity of human rights institutions and civil society organisations to promote and protect human rights; support the implementation of international human rights norms and standards and outcomes of the human rights mechanisms/bodies and to monitor the human rights situation in Uganda, in partnership with the Uganda Human Rights Commission (UHRC).
 Ondersteuning van het Human Rights Office in Oeganda</narrative>
  </description>
